                 " on it"
     }
+
+    /**
+     * If this mana is spent to cast your commander, it enters with additional counters equal to the
+     * number of times that commander has been cast from the command zone this game. Opal Palace:
+     * "If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters with a number of additional +1/+1
+     * counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game."
+     *
+     * On consumption the cast pipeline checks that the spell is one of the mana spender's own
+     * commanders (its `CommanderComponent` is owned by the caster) and reads **that** commander's
+     * own command-zone cast count — not a sum over a partner pair. The count is read after the cast
+     * is recorded, so it includes the cast in progress when the spell comes from the command zone
+     * (Opal Palace ruling 2020-11-10: the first command-zone cast gets one counter); a cast from any
+     * other zone doesn't add to it, and a countered earlier cast still counted. The counters are owed
+     * to the spell and placed as the permanent enters, so a spell that never resolves carries
+     * nothing. A noncommander spell, or a commander cast with other mana, gets nothing.
+     *
+     * Each rider-carrying mana spent adds its own counters: two such mana spent on one commander
+     * spell give twice the count (Opal Palace ruling 2020-11-10, Mana Reflection).
+     *
+     * @property counterType The kind of counter placed; +1/+1 for Opal Palace.
+     */
+    @SerialName("CommanderEntersWithCastCountCounters")
+    @Serializable
+    data class CommanderEntersWithCastCountCounters(
+        val counterType: CounterType = CounterType.PLUS_ONE_PLUS_ONE,
+    ) : ManaSpellRider {
+        override val description: String =
+            "If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters with a number of additional " +
+                "${counterType.printed} counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast " +
+                "from the command zone this game"
+    }
 }
 
